WEBVTT

00:00.150 --> 00:00.840
The Horsehead.

00:01.646 --> 00:08.030
Just beside Orion's belt, a dark cloud of dust stands in front of glowing gas, in the shape of a horse's head.

00:08.530 --> 00:10.075
Here the colours are chosen.

00:10.502 --> 00:18.282
The camera took the light of single gases through narrow filters, and each gas was given a colour so the eye can tell them apart.
